<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 402 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 402 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 402 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Rates were unchanged and bids (million dirhams) accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	BID     AMOUNT     INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    13 weeks	 25	 25	  7.50 percent</p>
<p>    26 weeks	190	190	  8.50</p>
<p>    52 weeks	 66	 66	  9.00</p>
<p>    Five years     50	 50	  10.00</p>
<p>    10 years	 50	 50	  10.25</p>
<p>    15 years	 21	 21	  10.50</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total:	   402     402</p>
<p>($1= 8.7 dirhams)</p>
<p>- Rabat newsroom (212-7) 726518</p>
</text>
